{"page":382,"verses":[{"verse_key":"27:56","surah":27,"ayah":56,"ar_uthmani":"۞ فَمَا كَانَ جَوَابَ قَوْمِهِۦٓ إِلَّآ أَن قَالُوٓا۟ أَخْرِجُوٓا۟ ءَالَ لُوطٍ مِّن قَرْيَتِكُمْ ۖ إِنَّهُمْ أُنَاسٌ يَتَطَهَّرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The only answer his people gave was to say, ‘Expel Lot’s followers from your town! These men mean to stay chaste!’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ فَمَا","en_gloss":"But not","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"27:56"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"27:56"},{"pos":3,"ar":"جَوَابَ","en_gloss":"(the) answer","transliteration":"jawāba","verse_key":"27:56"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَوْمِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"(of) his people","transliteration":"qawmihi","verse_key":"27:56"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَّآ","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"27:56"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"27:56"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"27:56"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَخْرِجُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"Drive out","transliteration":"akhrijū","verse_key":"27:56"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ءَالَ","en_gloss":"(the) family","transliteration":"āla","verse_key":"27:56"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لُوطٍۢ","en_gloss":"(of) Lut","transliteration":"lūṭin","verse_key":"27:56"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"27:56"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قَرْيَتِكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"your town","transliteration":"qaryatikum","verse_key":"27:56"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"Indeed, they","transliteration":"innahum","verse_key":"27:56"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أُنَاسٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) people","transliteration":"unāsun","verse_key":"27:56"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَتَطَهَّرُونَ","en_gloss":"who keep clean and pure","transliteration":"yataṭahharūna","verse_key":"27:56"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٥٦","en_gloss":"(56)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:56"}]},{"verse_key":"27:57","surah":27,"ayah":57,"ar_uthmani":"فَأَنجَيْنَـٰهُ وَأَهْلَهُۥٓ إِلَّا ٱمْرَأَتَهُۥ قَدَّرْنَـٰهَا مِنَ ٱلْغَـٰبِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We saved him and his family- except for his wife: We made her stay behind-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَأَنجَيْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"So We saved him","transliteration":"fa-anjaynāhu","verse_key":"27:57"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَأَهْلَهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"and his family","transliteration":"wa-ahlahu","verse_key":"27:57"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"27:57"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱمْرَأَتَهُۥ","en_gloss":"his wife","transliteration":"im'ra-atahu","verse_key":"27:57"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَدَّرْنَـٰهَا","en_gloss":"We destined her","transliteration":"qaddarnāhā","verse_key":"27:57"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"(to be) of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"27:57"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْغَـٰبِرِينَ","en_gloss":"those who remained behind","transliteration":"l-ghābirīna","verse_key":"27:57"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٥٧","en_gloss":"(57)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:57"}]},{"verse_key":"27:58","surah":27,"ayah":58,"ar_uthmani":"وَأَمْطَرْنَا عَلَيْهِم مَّطَرًا ۖ فَسَآءَ مَطَرُ ٱلْمُنذَرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and We brought rain down on them. How dreadful that rain was for those who had been warned!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَمْطَرْنَا","en_gloss":"And We rained","transliteration":"wa-amṭarnā","verse_key":"27:58"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَلَيْهِم","en_gloss":"upon them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"27:58"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَّطَرًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"a rain","transliteration":"maṭaran","verse_key":"27:58"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَسَآءَ","en_gloss":"and was evil","transliteration":"fasāa","verse_key":"27:58"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَطَرُ","en_gloss":"(the) rain","transliteration":"maṭaru","verse_key":"27:58"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْمُنذَرِينَ","en_gloss":"(on) those who were warned","transliteration":"l-mundharīna","verse_key":"27:58"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٥٨","en_gloss":"(58)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:58"}]},{"verse_key":"27:59","surah":27,"ayah":59,"ar_uthmani":"قُلِ ٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ وَسَلَـٰمٌ عَلَىٰ عِبَادِهِ ٱلَّذِينَ ٱصْطَفَىٰٓ ۗ ءَآللَّهُ خَيْرٌ أَمَّا يُشْرِكُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say [Prophet], ‘Praise be to God and peace on the servants He has chosen. Who is better: God, or those they set up as partners with Him?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلِ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"quli","verse_key":"27:59"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْحَمْدُ","en_gloss":"All praise (be)","transliteration":"l-ḥamdu","verse_key":"27:59"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"to Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"27:59"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَسَلَـٰمٌ","en_gloss":"and peace (be)","transliteration":"wasalāmun","verse_key":"27:59"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"upon","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"27:59"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عِبَادِهِ","en_gloss":"His slaves","transliteration":"ʿibādihi","verse_key":"27:59"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those whom","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"27:59"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱصْطَفَىٰٓ ۗ","en_gloss":"He has chosen","transliteration":"iṣ'ṭafā","verse_key":"27:59"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ءَآللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Is Allah","transliteration":"āllahu","verse_key":"27:59"},{"pos":10,"ar":"خَيْرٌ","en_gloss":"better","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"27:59"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَمَّا","en_gloss":"or what","transliteration":"ammā","verse_key":"27:59"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يُشْرِكُونَ","en_gloss":"they associate (with Him)","transliteration":"yush'rikūna","verse_key":"27:59"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٥٩","en_gloss":"(59)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"27:59"}]},{"verse_key":"27:60","surah":27,"ayah":60,"ar_uthmani":"أَمَّنْ خَلَقَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضَ وَأَنزَلَ لَكُم مِّنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ مَآءً فَأَنۢبَتْنَا بِهِۦ حَدَآئِقَ ذَاتَ بَهْجَةٍ مَّا كَانَ لَكُمْ أَن تُنۢبِتُوا۟ شَجَرَهَآ ۗ أَءِلَـٰهٌ مَّعَ ٱللَّهِ ۚ بَلْ هُمْ قَوْمٌ يَعْدِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Who created the heavens and earth? Who sends down water from the sky for you- with which We cause gardens of delight to grow: you have no power to make the trees grow in them- is it another god beside God? No! But they are people who take others to be equal with God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمَّنْ","en_gloss":"Or Who","transliteration":"amman","verse_key":"27:60"},{"pos":2,"ar":"خَلَقَ","en_gloss":"has created","transliteration":"khalaqa","verse_key":"27:60"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"27:60"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","verse_key":"27:60"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَأَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"and sent down","transliteration":"wa-anzala","verse_key":"27:60"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَكُم","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"27:60"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"27:60"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","en_gloss":"the sky","transliteration":"l-samāi","verse_key":"27:60"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَآءًۭ","en_gloss":"water","transliteration":"māan","verse_key":"27:60"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَأَنۢبَتْنَا","en_gloss":"And We caused to grow","transliteration":"fa-anbatnā","verse_key":"27:60"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"thereby","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"27:60"},{"pos":12,"ar":"حَدَآئِقَ","en_gloss":"gardens","transliteration":"ḥadāiqa","verse_key":"27:60"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ذَاتَ","en_gloss":"of beauty (and delight)","transliteration":"dhāta","verse_key":"27:60"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بَهْجَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"of beauty (and delight)","transliteration":"bahjatin","verse_key":"27:60"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"27:60"},{"pos":16,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"it is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"27:60"},{"pos":17,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"27:60"},{"pos":18,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"27:60"},{"pos":19,"ar":"تُنۢبِتُوا۟","en_gloss":"you cause to grow","transliteration":"tunbitū","verse_key":"27:60"},{"pos":20,"